{
  "epc_number": null,
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_agency": "Borough",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient information has been provided to demonstrate the proposal would address an identified local need for the proposed children’s care home and that the development is located within the community is intended to serve would be required. As such, the proposed change of use would be inappropriate for this site contrary to policies S4, HO7 and HO9 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policies D3, D14 and H12 of the London Plan (2021), Policy HO7 and Strategic Policy 03(7) of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal would result in the loss of existing family housing and no justification or reprovision has been provided to demonstrate that this loss is acceptable. The development would therefore result in an unwarranted reduction in the borough’s housing stock, contrary to the relevant provisions in the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policies H8A of the London Plan (2021) and Strategic policy 03(7) of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
